# tro-checks' build-reports (and build-candidates) stamp the hash of what they were made from, for
# tro-checks' own Regenerate workflows to decide whether to run. This repository has its own
# workflows and never reads it, and it is not something the checks say, so it is not committed.
/reports/last-generated.json
/candidates/last-generated.json
